        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "description": "Certificates the CA registry lists as revoked but still present in its signed directory: revoked and not yet cleaned. `puppetserver ca clean` revokes and deletes, so a cleaned node leaves the listing and zero is the healthy steady state. A count here is a tidy-up queue, not an alarm, and not comparable to the CRL tile. One value per PE (R93).",
      "id": 3491179
    },
