      "description": "Serials the CRL enforces. A lifetime total that only ever grows: one entry for every serial ever revoked over the life of the CA, so it does not track the CA tile and is not meant to. A revocation the CRL never enforced shows on CRL Freshness below, a stale last_update beside recent revocations. One value per PE (R93).",
      "id": 296337576
    },
