        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "description": "Whether the CA will issue a renewed certificate to an agent that asks (`allow-auto-renewal`). Off means every certificate in the estate is a manual job, and the expiry buckets below should then be read as real deadlines rather than as a rotation. One value per PE (R93).",
      "id": 777467100
    },
    {
      "title": "Alt Names Allowed",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 28
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "max by (alias) (puppet_ca_allow_subject_alt_names{alias=~\"${pe}\",job=~\"${pdctng_job}\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{alias}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "#8e949f",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "locale",
          "noValue": "Not collected"
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byType",
              "options": "number"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "type": "value",
                    "options": {
                      "1": {
                        "text": "On",
                        "color": "#8e949f",
                        "index": 0
                      },
                      "0": {
                        "text": "Off",
                        "color": "#0ca30c",
                        "index": 1
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "description": "Whether the CA will sign a certificate carrying a subject alternative name (`allow-subject-alt-names`). **On means a certificate can be issued bearing a name other than the one that requested it**, so anything trusting a certname -- an `auth.conf` rule, a `pp_auth_role` extension, an allowlist on this module's own API -- is trusting a name the CA is willing to hand to somebody else. **PE ships this on**, which is why On is neutral here rather than amber: it is the default, not a fault. Green is Off, because Off means somebody chose. Note the colours are the opposite way round from Auto-Renewal beside this, where On is the healthy answer. One value per PE (R93).",
      "id": 1344625283
    },
